# Allow-list: the build context carries only what the Dockerfile copies and
# builds. History, documentation, local state and secrets are not sent to the builder.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
!action
!testdata/fixture/discount
!examples/data/model-free-smoke.json
!scripts/model-free-smoke.sh

# Inside an allowed directory, still never send these.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
# Keep generated documentation and dependency directories out of product builds.
**/node_modules
**/.next
docs-site/content
docs-site/public
docs-site/.source
